{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21028","headline":"月漉漉篇 · 李贺","name":"月漉漉篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月漉漉，波烟玉。\n莎青桂花繁，芙蓉别江木。\n粉态裌罗寒，雁羽铺烟湿。\n谁能看石帆，乘船镜中入。\n秋白鲜红死，水香莲子齐。\n挽菱隔歌袖，绿刺罥银泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}